;\">10.1109/ICAIT61638.2024.10690667. </span><strong style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">YearofPublication:</strong><span style=\"text-align: justify; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">2024</span></li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>IJARCET</strong>:“AHybridApproachforSuitableContentNavigationBasedonWeightedClusteringfor Online Users”.</li>\n \t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">IARJSET:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit;\">“SmartAgriculturethroughvisionpredictingseedtraitsandgrowthfromasingleimage (SeedLens)”.</span></li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Membership in Professional Bodies</span></strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">1.The InstituteofEngineers(India),frommarch-27-2024,Membershipnumber:AM3122126</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 22.45pt; text-align: justify;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: 1pt solid black; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #002060; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 22.45pt; text-align: center;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Honours/Awards/</strong><strong> Achievements</strong></span>